sequenceDiagram
  participant S as GameSession
  participant B as BoostSystem
  participant N as BoostInventory
  participant P as PlayerController
  participant J as RunStateStore
  S->>B: Q then E press requests
  B->>N: read requested slot
  N-->>B: effect definition
  alt Activation is valid
    B->>P: apply effect
    B->>N: consume item
  else Empty or invalid
    B-->>S: retain slot contents
  end
  Note over S,J: World triggers follow movement contacts
  S->>N: pickup overlap, fill Q then E
  N-->>S: collected or full
  opt Pickup collected
    S->>S: mark spent and remove resident pickup
    S->>J: queue journal write
  end
  Note over N,J: Full slots leave the pickup available
  S->>B: armed pad entry
  B->>P: apply if valid, next tick
  Note over S,P: Any attempt latches until exit<br/>Success also starts 0.5 s cooldown
